      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 432,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "text": "(a)  broken input wire, Pi not yet\nbooted, or GPIO 18 released\nback to an input",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
